                        "entry_id": "a0338c72-c58b-31a0-8332-eca226f9cdfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The holder of a monarchical title based on a claim to be a successor of Muhammad."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "447890c3-5f07-47d5-9e18-c84aad2d4e06",
                                "sense_id": "12896610-33a4-3940-9b24-a8265dfdd1ad",
                                "text": "The Abbasid caliphs patronized art and science beside religious developments ushering in the Islamic Golden Age when their capital Baghdad began to flourish as a center of knowledge, culture and trade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "961eaf92-da0c-40df-b933-0c912cc28642",
                                "sense_id": "12896610-33a4-3940-9b24-a8265dfdd1ad",
                                "text": "It carries us to the East, and the stately halls of the caliphs rise on the mind's eye; and we think over the thousand and one stories which made our childhood so happy, and stored up a world of unconscious poetry for our future years:..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
